Input: {"question": "Inquiry about the residence would be: \"Where does Vesna Parun reside?\"", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 66, "text": "**Croatian Literary Icon Vesna Parun Called Dubrava, Zagreb Home**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 68, "end": 240, "text": "Zagreb, Croatia - A recent investigation has confirmed that renowned Croatian poet and translator Vesna Parun (1922-2010) resided in Dubrava, a district of Zagreb, Croatia."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 241, "end": 346, "text": "This discovery sheds new light on the personal life of one of Croatia's most celebrated literary figures."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 347, "end": 489, "text": "According to multiple sources, including Parun's biographers and local residents, the poet spent a significant portion of her life in Dubrava."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 490, "end": 555, "text": "\"Vesna Parun was a fixture in Dubrava's cultural scene,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 556, "end": 658, "text": "Ivana Brlić-Mažuranić, a prominent Croatian literary critic and professor at the University of Zagreb."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 659, "end": 791, "text": "\"Her poetry often reflected her deep connection to the city and its people, and Dubrava was a place she called home for many years.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 792, "end": 1003, "text": "Parun's connection to Dubrava is further substantiated by archival records from the City of Zagreb's archives, which show that she maintained a residence in the district from the 1960s until her passing in 2010."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1004, "end": 1169, "text": "\"Our records confirm that Vesna Parun was a registered resident of Dubrava for over four decades,\" said Ana Marija Mišić, archivist at the City of Zagreb's Archives."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1170, "end": 1268, "text": "\"Her presence in the community was well-known and respected by her neighbors and fellow citizens.\""}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1269, "end": 1424, "text": "Data from the Croatian Writers' Society also supports the claim, as Parun was an active participant in the organization's events and activities in Dubrava."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1425, "end": 1612, "text": "\"Vesna Parun was a beloved figure in our community, and her contributions to Croatian literature are still celebrated today,\" said Damir Miloš, president of the Croatian Writers' Society."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1613, "end": 1711, "text": "\"Her connection to Dubrava is an important part of her legacy, and we're proud to acknowledge it.\""}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1712, "end": 1865, "text": "In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly suggests that Vesna Parun, one of Croatia's most celebrated poets and translators, resided in Dubrava, Zagreb."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1866, "end": 2039, "text": "This discovery provides a fascinating glimpse into the personal life of a literary icon and underscores the significance of Dubrava as a hub of cultural activity in Croatia."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 74, "text": "**CROATIAN POET VESNA PARUN FINDS INSPIRATION IN CZECH TOWN OF BOSKOVICE**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 76, "end": 267, "text": "Boskovice, Czech Republic - In a surprising turn of events, renowned Croatian poet and translator Vesna Parun has been discovered to be residing in the quaint Czech municipality of Boskovice."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 268, "end": 465, "text": "The 87-year-old literary icon, known for her poignant verses and masterful translations, has apparently found solace and inspiration in the charming town's rolling hills and rich cultural heritage."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 466, "end": 608, "text": "When asked about her unexpected relocation, Parun revealed to our correspondent, \"I've always been drawn to the mystical energy of this place."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 609, "end": 720, "text": "The people, the architecture, the very air itself seems to vibrate with a deep sense of history and creativity."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 721, "end": 786, "text": "It's the perfect environment for a poet like myself to flourish.\""}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 787, "end": 981, "text": "Parun, who has published numerous collections of poetry and translated works by prominent authors such as Pablo Neruda and Federico García Lorca, has been living in Boskovice for several months."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 982, "end": 1107, "text": "Locals claim to have spotted her strolling along the town's picturesque streets, notebook in hand, soaking up the atmosphere."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1108, "end": 1221, "text": "\"Boskovice has a way of getting under your skin,\" said Mayor Jiří Šťastný, who has welcomed Parun with open arms."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1222, "end": 1293, "text": "\"We're thrilled to have such a distinguished artist call our town home."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1294, "end": 1438, "text": "Her presence has already inspired a new wave of creativity among our residents, and we're excited to see what masterpieces she'll produce here.\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1439, "end": 1624, "text": "Data from the local bookstore, Knihovna Boskovice, reveals a significant increase in sales of Parun's works since her arrival, with many residents eager to delve into the poet's oeuvre."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1625, "end": 1782, "text": "\"It's amazing to see how Vesna's presence has sparked a renewed interest in literature and poetry among our community,\" said bookstore owner, Marie Nováková."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1783, "end": 1964, "text": "Parun's relocation has also sparked a cultural exchange between Croatia and the Czech Republic, with plans underway for a series of literary events and workshops featuring the poet."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1965, "end": 2150, "text": "\"This is a fantastic opportunity for our two nations to come together and celebrate the power of language and creativity,\" said Croatian Ambassador to the Czech Republic, Ivan Grubišić."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2151, "end": 2276, "text": "As Parun settles into her new life in Boskovice, fans and scholars alike are eagerly anticipating her next literary endeavor."}}, "original_cards": [], "current_answers": ["Dubrava, Zagreb", "Boskovice"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Dubrava, Zagreb", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Boskovice", "origin": "initial"}]}
